{"step_index":137,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T19:03:46Z","thinking":"**Prioritizing Tool Usage**\n\nI'm now focusing on tool selection, understanding that choosing the right tool is key. My aim is to leverage the most specialized tool available for each specific task to avoid unnecessary complexity. The broader tools will be considered only when a specific tool does not exist. I'm carefully analyzing the available tools to ensure I pick the most efficient one.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"from fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel\nimport math\nfrom sgp4_calc import find_close_approaches\n\napp = FastAPI(title=\"Space Debris Collision Avoidance API\")\n\napp.add_middleware(\n    CORSMiddleware,\n    allow_origins=[\"*\"],\n    allow_credentials=True,\n    allow_methods=[\"*\"],\n    allow_headers=[\"*\"],\n)\n\nclass MissionRiskRequest(BaseModel):\n    altitude_km: float\n    area_m2: float\n    time_years: float\n\n@app.get(\"/api/conjunctions\")\ndef get_conjunctions():\n    \"\"\"\n    Endpoint to trigger the close approach calculation and return the risk-ranked list.\n    \"\"\"\n    results = find_close_approaches(hours=24, step_minutes=5)\n    return {\"conjunctions\": results}\n\n@app.post(\"/api/mission-risk\")\ndef calculate_mission_risk(params: MissionRiskRequest):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the probability of at least one debris impact using the Poisson distribution.\n    \"\"\"\n    alt = params.altitude_km\n    area = params.area_m2\n    time = params.time_years\n    \n    # Debris flux F calculation based on altitude\n    if alt < 500:\n        flux = 5.0e-5\n    elif 500 <= alt <= 900:\n        flux = 3.5e-4\n    else:\n        flux = 1.0e-4\n        \n    # Expected number of impacts (lambda)\n    lam = flux * area * time\n    \n    # Probability of at least one impact: P = 1 - exp(-lambda)\n    prob = 1.0 - math.exp(-lam)\n    prob_percent = prob * 100.0\n    \n    # Risk Rating\n    if prob_percent < 1:\n        risk_rating = \"LOW\"\n    elif prob_percent <= 5:\n        risk_rating = \"MODERATE\"\n    else:\n        risk_rating = \"HIGH\"\n    \n    return {\n        \"altitude_km\": alt,\n        \"area_m2\": area,\n        \"time_years\": time,\n        \"flux_per_m2_year\": flux,\n        \"expected_impacts\": lam,\n        \"probability_percentage\": prob_percent,\n        \"risk_rating\": risk_rating\n    }\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import uvicorn\n    uvicorn.run(\"main:app\", host=\"127.0.0.1\", port=8000, reload=True)","Description":"Updated main.py to exactly match the new MissionRiskRequest requirements.","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/anandgopaltiwary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/space_debris_prototype/backend/main.py","toolAction":"Rewriting main.py","toolSummary":"Update main.py"}}]}
